{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle Kingdom</strong><br>Idle Kingdom is an idle game inspired by old-school RPGs. It offers a wide variety of skills to enhance your character's growth and strength. From combat to gathering, Idle Kingdom has a bit of everything you could want. Train endlessly, defeat enemies, and collect their rare loot for yourself. You can also craft your own equipment and train various non-combat skills. Idle Kingdom is perfect for scratching that &quot;number-go-up&quot; itch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skills</strong><br>Players can train a variety of skills, whether they choose to become a warrior, archer, or mage! If combat isn\u2019t your style, you can focus on classic skills such as mining, woodcutting, fishing, cooking, smithing, artisanry, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades</strong><br>Visit the market to purchase upgrades that make your adventure easier and more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enemies</strong><br>Idle Kingdom features multiple areas filled with enemies to defeat. Explore them all to test your strength and claim rewards!<br><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We also offer a number of minigames for players to enjoy. These fun challenges provide a great way to earn extra rewards.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"99 Attack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423800/1944c976f1eed9347cc0c560aa872d8456119c7a.jpg"},{"name":"99 Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423800/9fec95d276ea5fc8a8dff28af5b29aa0cdd1fa8e.jpg"},{"name":"99 Defence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423800/fbc9f3523c020dcffcb77ee2773b303edf681f62.jpg"},{"name":"99 Archery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423800/ec24c06c0463a22aec5286150e1bee1185b08d63.jpg"},{"name":"99 Magic","